  "title": "Vegan Coconut Fudge Sandwiches Recalled Over Undeclared Egg",
  "summary": "Vegan Coconut Fudge Sandwiches sold in Michigan are being recalled after a vegan ingredient was found to contain undeclared egg. Learn about affected products, recall details, allergy risks, and what consumers should do. Consumers who purchased certain Vegan Non-Dairy Frozen Dessert Coconut Fudge Sandwiches in Michigan are being urged to check their products after a recall was announced because the dessert may contain undeclared egg. The recall involves a product made by Blank Slate Creamery,",
